/* Transit interpretations: Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, Pluto and Chiron aspecting natal points (conjunction, soft, hard) */
window.AstroDeep = window.AstroDeep || {};
window.AstroDeep.transitAspects = {
  "jupiter|sun": {
    conj: "Jupiter crossing your Sun happens roughly once every twelve years and usually lasts a few weeks, longer if retrograde brings it back. Confidence tends to rise, and people often notice you more readily: a promotion conversation, an invitation to lead, a chance to travel or study. You may feel generous and larger than life. The trap is overpromising, saying yes to everything because it all looks possible. Pick one or two openings that genuinely reflect who you are becoming and give them your full weight.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Jupiter to your Sun brings a few weeks of easy momentum. Doors you have been knocking on may open with less effort, and support from mentors or teachers often arrives on time. The energy is pleasant enough to waste, so name something concrete you want to grow, such as a course, a pitch or a trip, and act while goodwill is running high.",
    hard: "When Jupiter squares or opposes your Sun, ambition and appetite can outrun your capacity for a few weeks. You may feel restless, sure that life should be bigger than it is, and tempted to overcommit, overspend or overstate your case. Opportunities still come, yet they tend to require a sharper judgement about scale. The opposition often arrives through other people: a partner or rival whose success makes you question your own path. Use the energy to stretch, then check your plans against your actual time and resources."
  },
  "jupiter|moon": {
    conj: "With Jupiter passing over your Moon, the emotional climate often warms for several weeks. Home, family and your private life tend to expand: a move, a renovation, a new arrival, a house full of guests, or simply a stronger sense of belonging. You may feel more generous and more easily moved. Feelings can also swell past their usual banks, so comfort eating or promising too much to family is common. Let yourself be nourished, and notice which kinds of care actually refill you.",
    soft: "Jupiter trining or sextiling your Moon gives a few weeks of emotional ease. Relationships with family, especially women in your life, often feel supportive, and small domestic plans come together. You may find it easier to ask for what you need. Use this gentle window to strengthen routines that help you feel safe, or to reconnect with someone you have drifted from.",
    hard: "Jupiter square or opposite your Moon tends to inflate moods and needs for a few weeks. You might feel restless at home, wanting more space, more comfort or more attention than your current situation offers. Family matters can feel oversized, and small grievances may be magnified. Overindulgence, whether in food, spending or reassurance-seeking, is a common release valve. The useful work is identifying the real hunger underneath and meeting it directly. A modest change to how you live often satisfies more than a dramatic one."
  },
  "jupiter|mercury": {
    conj: "Jupiter joining your natal Mercury opens a few weeks of busy, expansive thinking. Ideas tend to arrive quickly, and you may feel drawn to write, teach, study, sign agreements or plan travel. Conversations often lead somewhere useful, and people seem more willing to listen. The risk is scattered attention: too many tabs open, too many projects started, details skipped in the rush of the big picture. Capture everything, then choose the one idea with the most substance and see it through to a finished draft.",
    soft: "With Jupiter in easy aspect to Mercury, communication and learning flow well for a few weeks. Interviews, negotiations, applications and writing projects often go smoothly, and you may find the right words more easily than usual. Short trips and new contacts can prove useful. It is a good moment to put ideas on paper or ask a well-placed question.",
    hard: "When Jupiter squares or opposes your Mercury, your mind tends to race ahead of the facts. For a few weeks you may be tempted to promise more than you can deliver, skim contracts, or argue a big idea without checking the detail. Other people may challenge your views, which can feel irritating but often sharpens your thinking. Paperwork and travel plans deserve a second look. Slow down enough to read the fine print, and use the debate to test which of your beliefs actually hold."
  },
  "jupiter|venus": {
    conj: "Jupiter meeting your Venus is one of the more pleasurable transits, usually lasting a few weeks. Affection, social life and enjoyment tend to expand. You may meet someone appealing, feel renewed warmth in an existing relationship, or find more pleasure in art, beauty and good company. Money matters can seem easier too. The shadow is excess: overspending, overindulging, or accepting flattery at face value. Enjoy the sweetness, and let it teach you what you genuinely value rather than simply what feels nice today.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Jupiter to Venus brings a few weeks of social ease and good feeling. Invitations, reconciliations and creative inspiration often arrive naturally, and people tend to respond warmly to you. It is a fine time to host, create, refresh your surroundings or say something kind you have been holding back.",
    hard: "Jupiter square or opposite Venus tends to raise your appetite for pleasure, love and comfort for several weeks. You may crave more affection than a partner is offering, or feel drawn to someone or something that promises more than it can give. Spending on treats and indulgences often climbs. There is still real warmth available here; the challenge is proportion. Ask whether a desire reflects a lasting value or a passing mood, and give yourself pleasures that do not leave a hangover."
  },
  "jupiter|mars": {
    conj: "When Jupiter joins your Mars, energy and courage tend to surge for a few weeks. You may feel ready to launch a venture, compete, train harder or take a bold step you have been circling. Others often respond to your confidence and join in. Because the drive feels limitless, you can take on too much, push your body past sensible limits or pick fights on principle. Aim this fire at one worthwhile goal, and build in recovery so the momentum lasts beyond the transit.",
    soft: "With Jupiter trine or sextile Mars, effort tends to pay off for a few weeks. Physical activity feels good, projects move forward with less friction, and you may find the nerve to start something you had been postponing. Timing tends to be on your side. Use it to make a decisive move or build stamina in a new discipline.",
    hard: "Jupiter square or opposite Mars can feel like driving with the accelerator jammed down. For a few weeks you may be impatient, restless and inclined to overreach, whether in work, exercise or conflict. Competitive situations can escalate, and accidents are more likely when you rush. The energy itself is valuable. Channel it into demanding physical effort or a clearly defined challenge, and pause before sending the heated message. Doing less, with more focus, often achieves more than doing everything at once."
  },
  "jupiter|jupiter": {
    conj: "Your Jupiter return comes roughly every twelve years, around ages 12, 24, 36, 48, 60 and 72, and its themes can colour most of a year. It marks the start of a new growth cycle. You may feel an urge to widen your life through study, travel, a new belief system or a larger role. Opportunities often appear that echo what you planted twelve years earlier. Reflect on what has genuinely grown since then, and set a clear intention for the next twelve-year chapter.",
    soft: "When Jupiter trines or sextiles its own natal position, growth tends to come through steady, natural expansion for a few weeks. Your beliefs and your circumstances seem to agree. It is a helpful window for learning, teaching, publishing or making a generous gesture. Opportunities may feel modest, yet they often lead somewhere worthwhile if you follow them.",
    hard: "The Jupiter square arrives about three years after each return and the opposition around six years after, lasting weeks to a few months. You may feel your current path has become too small or your beliefs no longer fit, and the urge to break out can be strong. The opposition often brings a partner, teacher or opponent who challenges your worldview. This is a checkpoint in the twelve-year cycle. Review what you started at the last return, trim what has become excess, and invest in what still has room to grow."
  },
  "jupiter|saturn": {
    conj: "Jupiter joining your natal Saturn tends to bring a few weeks when effort and opportunity finally meet. Long-term projects, careers and commitments may receive recognition or a practical step up. You may feel more hopeful about areas where you usually feel limited or anxious. The transit rewards realistic planning, so it is a good time to formalise an arrangement, secure a role or commit to a sensible structure. Keep ambition grounded, and let a measured sense of optimism loosen an old fear.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Jupiter to Saturn supports patient, sensible progress for a few weeks. Responsibilities may feel lighter, and people in authority are often more receptive. It is a strong window for planning, negotiating terms, or building a routine that will last. Growth here is quiet but durable.",
    hard: "When Jupiter squares or opposes your Saturn, you may feel pulled between expansion and caution for a few weeks. A promising opportunity might arrive alongside a limitation, or your enthusiasm could collide with a practical constraint, such as a budget or a boss. Frustration is common, but so is clarity about what is realistic. Treat it as a negotiation between hope and prudence. Scale plans to the resources you actually have, and let some hesitation be good judgement rather than fear."
  },
  "jupiter|asc": {
    conj: "Jupiter crossing your Ascendant begins a new twelve-year cycle of personal growth, and it often lasts several weeks. You may appear more confident and approachable, and people tend to respond with interest. New starts in appearance, health habits, travel or how you present yourself are common. Weight and appetite can increase too, since Jupiter enlarges what it touches. Use the extra visibility to introduce yourself to the circles you want to join, and let your outward style catch up with who you have become.",
    soft: "Jupiter in easy aspect to your Ascendant tends to make first impressions and personal initiatives flow for a few weeks. You may find yourself welcomed into new groups, feel physically brighter, or receive encouragement from others. It is a helpful time for interviews, meeting new people or trying a fresh approach to how you present yourself.",
    hard: "Jupiter squaring your Ascendant, or opposing it from your seventh house, highlights the balance between your own growth and the people around you for several weeks. The opposition often brings significant partnerships forward, sometimes a generous new ally, sometimes a partner whose needs compete with yours. The square can pull you between public ambitions and personal comfort. Enthusiasm may lead you to overstate yourself. Aim to grow through collaboration, and notice where you are giving away more space than you intend."
  },
  "jupiter|mc": {
    conj: "When Jupiter reaches your Midheaven, career and public standing often come into a favourable spotlight, typically for several weeks, and it may pass more than once. Promotions, recognition, new responsibilities or a clearer sense of direction are common. People in authority can be more willing to back you. This transit marks a high point in Jupiter's twelve-year cycle through your chart. Step forward, apply, pitch, and let yourself be seen, while keeping promises within what you can sustain once the spotlight moves on.",
    soft: "Jupiter trine or sextile your Midheaven tends to support steady career progress for a few weeks. Recognition may come quietly, through a good review, a useful contact or a project that goes well. It is a supportive time to clarify goals, seek advice from mentors or take a modest professional step that aligns with your longer aims.",
    hard: "Jupiter square your Midheaven, or opposite it from the fourth house, can stir tension between career growth and home life for several weeks. You might be offered more at work just as family needs increase, or feel tempted to expand your role beyond what is realistic. The opposition often turns attention inward, toward home, roots and foundations. Treat it as a prompt to rebalance. Decide what success genuinely means to you now, and let that guide which offers to accept."
  },
  "jupiter|northNode": {
    conj: "Jupiter crossing your North Node tends to bring encouragement toward your direction of growth for a few weeks. People, ideas or opportunities may appear that seem to point you forward, and choices aligned with your longer purpose often feel unexpectedly easy. Chance meetings can prove significant. You may feel optimistic about stepping into unfamiliar territory. Say yes to the invitations that stretch you in the direction you already sense is right, even if they feel slightly outside your comfort zone.",
    soft: "Jupiter trining or sextiling your North Node offers a few weeks of gentle support for personal growth. Helpful people and timely opportunities may nudge you toward new habits or roles. Nothing may feel dramatic, yet small steps now tend to align with a larger direction. Follow curiosity and notice which connections feel meaningful.",
    hard: "When Jupiter squares your nodal axis, you may feel pulled between old comfortable patterns and the growth you know you need, usually for a few weeks. Opportunities can look tempting yet lead you sideways, back toward familiar habits dressed up as progress. Jupiter opposite the North Node sits on the South Node, which can make old talents easy to lean on. Enjoy that competence, then ask whether each choice moves you forward or simply keeps you comfortable."
  },
  "saturn|sun": {
    conj: "Saturn crossing your Sun happens about once every 29 years and can shape a whole year, with up to three exact passes. Life tends to ask for a serious reckoning with who you are and what you are building. Energy may feel lower, and responsibilities heavier, yet effort made now tends to last. Many people take on a defining commitment, leave a role that no longer fits, or finally claim real authority. Rest well, simplify, and put your weight behind one worthwhile structure.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Saturn to your Sun supports steady, earned progress over several months. Discipline comes more naturally, and older or more experienced people may recognise your competence. It is a good period to formalise plans, set long-term goals or build a routine you can sustain. Rewards may be modest but they tend to hold.",
    hard: "Saturn square or opposite your Sun often lasts most of a year, with several exact passes. You may meet obstacles, delays or people in authority who test your resolve, and confidence can dip. Health and vitality deserve care, since stress tends to show in the body. The pressure has a purpose: it reveals which efforts are worth continuing and which were built on hope alone. Keep going where the foundations are sound, let go where they are not, and ask for practical help."
  },
  "saturn|moon": {
    conj: "When Saturn sits on your Moon, emotional life often becomes quieter and more sober for several months. You may feel more alone, more responsible for family, or more aware of old insecurities. Caring for a parent, restructuring your home or facing a long-held fear are common themes. It can feel heavy, yet it builds emotional maturity. Give feelings a steady container: regular sleep, a reliable routine, a trusted listener. What you learn about self-care now tends to stay with you.",
    soft: "Saturn in trine or sextile to your Moon brings emotional steadiness over several months. You may find it easier to set boundaries with family, organise your home life, or commit to routines that genuinely support you. Relationships with older relatives can improve. It is a solid time to put domestic foundations in order.",
    hard: "Saturn square or opposite your Moon can feel like a long grey stretch, often lasting most of a year across several passes. You may feel undernourished, lonely or weighed down by family duties, and old hurts can resurface. Moods tend to be flatter and sleep may suffer. The transit asks you to become a better parent to yourself. Identify one or two things that genuinely comfort you, protect them, and let go of obligations you carry mainly out of guilt."
  },
  "saturn|mercury": {
    conj: "Saturn crossing your Mercury tends to make thinking slower, deeper and more careful for a few months. You may be studying for a qualification, writing something substantial, dealing with contracts or learning a demanding skill. Communication can feel effortful, and pessimism may creep into your self-talk. The upside is precision: ideas worked through now tend to be sound. Break mental tasks into manageable pieces, check your facts, and challenge gloomy thoughts with evidence before accepting them.",
    soft: "Saturn trine or sextile Mercury supports focused, practical thinking for several months. Detailed work, study, planning and formal writing often go well because you can concentrate. It is a good time to sign sensible agreements, organise paperwork or learn a structured skill. People tend to take your words seriously.",
    hard: "Saturn square or opposite your Mercury can bring months of mental strain, often with more than one exact pass. Communication may meet obstacles, such as delays, misunderstandings, bureaucracy or critics who question your ideas. You may doubt your intelligence or worry more than usual. Treat the friction as quality control. Revise, rehearse, get things in writing, and allow extra time for decisions. Where negative thinking takes hold, write it down and test it against what you actually know."
  },
  "saturn|venus": {
    conj: "Saturn meeting your Venus asks for honesty about love, money and what you value, typically across several months. Relationships may be tested by practical realities, distance or commitment decisions. Some partnerships deepen into something lasting; others show their limits. Finances often call for budgeting and restraint. You may feel less attractive or less appreciated for a time. Invest in the relationships and pleasures that hold up under scrutiny, and let go of ones that only work when nothing is required.",
    soft: "With Saturn trine or sextile Venus, relationships and finances tend to settle into steadier shape over several months. It can be a good time to formalise a partnership, make a sensible purchase or commit to a creative discipline. Loyalty and reliability feel attractive now, and quiet affection tends to deepen.",
    hard: "Saturn square or opposite your Venus can bring several months of relational and financial pressure. You may feel unloved, taken for granted or stuck in an arrangement that asks too much. Money can be tighter, and pleasures may feel rationed. Some relationships end; others mature through honest negotiation. Look at where you have been giving to earn affection, or tolerating what you do not value. Clear agreements and realistic expectations tend to relieve much of the strain."
  },
  "saturn|mars": {
    conj: "Saturn joining your Mars tends to bring months of effort against resistance. You may feel blocked, frustrated or physically tired, as if every action requires double the push. Anger can simmer beneath a controlled surface. Yet this transit is excellent for disciplined work: training programmes, construction projects, sustained campaigns. Strength built slowly now tends to last. Pace yourself, avoid forcing situations that clearly need time, and give frustration a physical outlet.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Saturn to Mars supports disciplined, effective action for several months. Hard work tends to bring results, and you may find the patience to finish long tasks. It is a strong period for building fitness, completing projects or taking on a demanding challenge with a clear plan.",
    hard: "Saturn square or opposite your Mars often lasts much of a year and can feel like pushing a boulder uphill. Efforts meet obstacles, and you may clash with authority or feel your initiative is being stifled. Suppressed anger and fatigue are common, and rushing increases the risk of strain or injury. Pick your battles carefully. Put energy into tasks where persistence pays, choose steady exercise over heroic effort, and address conflict directly before resentment hardens."
  },
  "saturn|jupiter": {
    conj: "When Saturn reaches your natal Jupiter, beliefs and ambitions tend to meet reality for several months. Plans that were built on optimism alone may stall, while those backed by skill and preparation can finally take form. You may reassess your faith, education or philosophy, keeping what has proven true. Growth now is measured and deliberate. It is a good time to consolidate gains, set realistic long-term goals and trade grand vision for workable strategy.",
    soft: "Saturn trine or sextile your Jupiter supports steady, sensible growth over several months. Opportunities tend to be practical and sustainable. It is a useful time to formalise education, invest in a long-term plan or commit to a teacher or structure that supports your development. Patience here is rewarded.",
    hard: "Saturn square or opposite Jupiter can bring several months of friction between hope and constraint. Expansion plans may be delayed, and you might question beliefs or commitments that once inspired you. Travel, study or publishing may face obstacles. The pressure clarifies which ambitions are grounded. Scale back where optimism outran your resources, keep investing where the foundations are firm, and allow the slower pace to make your plans sturdier."
  },
  "saturn|saturn": {
    conj: "The Saturn return arrives around ages 29 to 30 and again around 58 to 59, often unfolding over a year or more. It tends to bring a reckoning with adulthood: career, relationships, home and identity are tested for solidity. Structures built on others' expectations may crack, while those that reflect you tend to strengthen. Many people make defining commitments or exits. Take stock honestly, choose what you are willing to be responsible for, and build the next three decades on that.",
    soft: "Saturn's trines and sextiles to its natal place, around ages 5, 10, 20, 24 and 35 among others, tend to bring quiet consolidation. Over several months, effort and structure seem to cooperate, and responsibilities feel manageable. It is a good period to build skills, stabilise routines or take on a sensible commitment.",
    hard: "Saturn's squares and opposition to itself come at roughly 7, 14, 21, 36, 44 and 51, each lasting several months to a year. These are checkpoints in the 29-year cycle. The square around 7 and 36 often tests new structures; the opposition near 14 and 44 brings outside pressure to show what you have built; the square near 21 and 51 asks for adjustment before the next return. Expect friction with authority or limits. Repair what is weak, and keep faith with long-term aims."
  },
  "saturn|asc": {
    conj: "Saturn crossing your Ascendant marks the start of a new 29-year cycle of personal responsibility, typically lasting several months. You may feel more serious, reserved or tired, and people may treat you as more of an authority. Health, appearance and daily discipline often come into focus. It can be a lonely stretch, yet it builds real presence. Take care of your body, define how you want to show up, and commit to the self you are becoming.",
    soft: "Saturn in trine or sextile to your Ascendant tends to support steady self-development over several months. You may find it easier to adopt healthy routines, present yourself with authority, or take on responsibility gracefully. People often see you as reliable. It is a sound time for building personal credibility.",
    hard: "Saturn opposite your Ascendant, crossing your Descendant, brings relationships under serious review for several months; commitments may be made, tested or ended. Saturn square the Ascendant tends to create friction between personal needs and outside obligations, often through career or family pressure. Both can feel restrictive. Clarify your terms in partnerships, accept responsibility where it genuinely belongs to you, and return the rest. Structures built now tend to last."
  },
  "saturn|mc": {
    conj: "Saturn reaching your Midheaven is often a career culmination, lasting several months and sometimes passing three times. Efforts made over the past fourteen years or so tend to be evaluated: some people reach a peak of recognition and authority, while others face the consequences of a path built on shaky ground. Responsibility tends to increase either way. Accept the role you have earned, handle it with integrity, and be honest about whether this summit is one you still want to be standing on.",
    soft: "Saturn trine or sextile your Midheaven supports solid career progress for several months. Hard work tends to be noticed by people in authority, and practical steps toward long-term goals are well-starred. It is a good period for building a professional reputation, taking a course or accepting a responsibility that suits you.",
    hard: "Saturn square your Midheaven, or opposite it from your fourth house, tends to bring several months of pressure around career and home. The square often arrives as a professional test: new demands, an unsupportive boss, or a sense that your direction needs correcting. The opposition turns attention to foundations, such as family, housing or inner security. Both reward honest reassessment. Shore up what is foundational, and make changes you can sustain."
  },
  "saturn|northNode": {
    conj: "Saturn crossing your North Node tends to make your growth path feel serious and demanding for several months. The direction you sense you need to move in may require real commitment, and you may meet responsibilities or mentors who push you there. Progress can feel slow, but effort now tends to align you with a longer purpose. Choose one concrete step toward your developmental direction and persist with it, even when old habits feel easier.",
    soft: "With Saturn trine or sextile your North Node, disciplined effort tends to support personal growth over several months. Structures, teachers or responsibilities may appear that help you mature in the direction you are meant to go. It is a good time to commit to practices that stretch you steadily.",
    hard: "Saturn square your nodal axis, or conjunct your South Node, can bring several months of feeling stuck between past and future. Old patterns may demand attention, or familiar roles may feel heavy and unrewarding. Responsibilities may seem to pull you away from growth. The pressure often clarifies what you have outgrown. Honour obligations that genuinely matter, release those that keep you small, and take the narrow path forward even if it feels unfamiliar."
  },
  "uranus|sun": {
    conj: "Uranus crossing your Sun happens at most once in a lifetime and often spans a year or two, with up to three exact passes. You may feel an urgent need to be more authentically yourself, and restlessness with any role that feels scripted. Sudden changes in work, relationships or location are common. The upheaval tends to liberate, even when it arrives unexpectedly. Make room for experimentation, avoid burning bridges in a rush, and let your identity update in stages.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Uranus to your Sun brings months of fresh possibilities without too much disruption. New interests, unconventional people and exciting ideas may arrive at the right moment. You tend to feel freer and more inventive. It is a great time to try something different, update your image or take a calculated risk.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Sun, often unfolding over a year or more, tends to shake up whatever feels too confining. Jobs, relationships or life structures may change suddenly, sometimes by your own choice and sometimes by others'. You may feel restless, nervy or rebellious. Resisting change tends to make it more abrupt. Ask where you have been living by someone else's rules, make deliberate changes before they are forced, and keep a few stable anchors."
  },
  "uranus|moon": {
    conj: "Uranus joining your Moon tends to disrupt emotional habits and home life over a year or more. Moves, changes in household, new family dynamics or a surprising emotional awakening are common. You may feel restless in situations that once felt safe, and moods can swing without warning. This transit frees you from emotional patterns you inherited. Allow feelings to change shape, create a little space for independence, and look after your nervous system with regular rest.",
    soft: "Uranus trining or sextiling your Moon tends to refresh emotional life over several months. You may feel more open to new domestic arrangements, unusual friendships or a different rhythm at home. Changes tend to feel exciting and manageable. It is a good time to rearrange your space, try new routines or let someone see a less familiar side of you.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Moon can bring a year or more of emotional instability. Home situations may shift suddenly, relationships may feel unsettled, and you may crave freedom one moment and security the next. Anxiety and restlessness are common. The transit asks you to loosen emotional habits that no longer serve you. Build flexibility into your routine, allow some change voluntarily, and treat sudden feelings as information before acting on them."
  },
  "uranus|mercury": {
    conj: "When Uranus meets your Mercury, thinking tends to speed up and change direction, often across a year or so. Sudden insights, new interests, technological learning and unexpected news are common. You may feel mentally electric, inventive and impatient with slow minds. Restlessness can make concentration difficult and speech abrupt. Capture ideas as they come, give yourself outlets for experimentation, and check your words before sending them when adrenaline is high.",
    soft: "Uranus trine or sextile your Mercury tends to spark original thinking over several months. New technologies, subjects or communities may capture your interest, and solutions often arrive in flashes, in the shower or halfway through a walk. It is an excellent period for creative problem solving, writing, and learning a skill that brings your toolkit up to date.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Mercury can bring a year or so of mental restlessness. Plans may change abruptly, communication may be disrupted, and you might feel nervy or scattered. Other people's opinions can provoke you, and you may say things impulsively. Treat the tension as an invitation to rethink stale assumptions. Build in pauses before decisions, keep backups of important documents, and let new ideas settle before acting."
  },
  "uranus|venus": {
    conj: "Uranus crossing your Venus tends to shake up love, values and finances over a year or more. You may feel drawn to new people, unusual relationships or a different aesthetic. Existing partnerships often need more freedom or honesty to survive. Money may come and go unexpectedly. The transit wakes up desire and shows where you have settled for less than you want. Be honest with yourself about what you value, and change what needs changing without abandoning what still works.",
    soft: "Uranus in trine or sextile to Venus brings months of fresh energy in love, style and creativity. You may meet interesting people, enjoy new experiences or feel freer in how you express affection. It is a lovely time to change your look, explore a new art form, or introduce playfulness into a relationship.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Venus can unsettle relationships and finances for a year or more. You may feel restless with a partner, drawn to someone new, or suddenly aware that a relationship needs more freedom. Money can fluctuate unexpectedly. The challenge is distinguishing real needs from impulse. Make space for honest conversations, experiment within agreements, and avoid rash financial or relational decisions made solely to escape feeling bored."
  },
  "uranus|mars": {
    conj: "Uranus joining your Mars tends to bring surges of energy and a strong urge to act independently, often across a year or so. You may start new ventures abruptly, leave confining situations or take up unusual physical pursuits. Impatience and a quick temper are common, and rushing can lead to accidents. This transit frees your will. Direct the energy into initiatives that matter, take safety precautions, and pause before reacting to provocations.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Uranus to Mars tends to bring bursts of inventive energy over several months. You may find new ways to work, train or compete, and courage to act on ideas quickly. It is a great time to start a bold project or try a new sport.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Mars can create a year or more of volatile energy. Frustration may erupt suddenly, and you may clash with people who seem to block your freedom. Accidents and impulsive decisions are more likely when you are tense. The underlying message is that your drive needs new outlets. Find physical ways to discharge tension, take care around machinery and traffic, and redirect rebellion toward constructive change."
  },
  "uranus|jupiter": {
    conj: "Uranus crossing your Jupiter tends to open sudden opportunities over a year or so. Unexpected travel, new studies, a change in beliefs or a lucky break can arrive with little warning. You may feel drawn to unconventional teachers or ideas. Enthusiasm can outrun judgement, so impulsive leaps deserve some checking. Stay open to surprises, test new ventures on a small scale first, and let your worldview update.",
    soft: "With Uranus trine or sextile your Jupiter, months of stimulating possibility tend to open up. A course, a trip or an offer may arrive out of the blue, and ideas that once seemed far-fetched start to look workable. Follow curiosity, explore alternative approaches, and take the kind of calculated leap you would normally talk yourself out of.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Jupiter can stir restlessness and the urge for sudden expansion over a year or so. You may feel tempted to abandon commitments for a new cause, belief or opportunity. Risk-taking can rise, especially financially. The energy is useful when channelled, since it pushes you beyond outdated beliefs. Explore freely, but avoid gambling what you cannot afford to lose, and let new ideas prove themselves before you build a life around them."
  },
  "uranus|saturn": {
    conj: "When Uranus meets your natal Saturn, established structures tend to be tested over a year or so. Work arrangements, commitments or long-held rules may suddenly feel too rigid, and you may meet unexpected changes to responsibilities or authority. The tension between security and freedom can be intense. The transit asks you to update old structures without destroying useful ones. Keep what is solid, renovate what is outdated, and allow some innovation into your plans.",
    soft: "Uranus in trine or sextile to Saturn supports practical innovation over several months. You may find ways to modernise how you work, update tired routines or restructure a commitment without losing stability. Old and new can cooperate now. Introduce a new system, renegotiate a role, or reform a long-standing habit while the change feels manageable.",
    hard: "Uranus square or opposite your Saturn can feel like a tug of war between the need for change and the need for stability, often lasting a year or more. Authority figures, rules or long-term commitments may be challenged suddenly. You may feel trapped or impatient with restrictions. The transit favours measured reform over revolt. Identify what truly needs changing, plan transitions carefully, and avoid clinging to structures simply because they are familiar."
  },
  "uranus|asc": {
    conj: "Uranus crossing your Ascendant tends to change how you present yourself and how others see you, often over a year or two. You may feel compelled to update your appearance, lifestyle or personal direction. Sudden opportunities or disruptions can reshape your path. The transit awakens independence. Allow yourself to change, experiment with new expressions of identity, and avoid impulsive decisions that could compromise health or safety.",
    soft: "Uranus trine or sextile your Ascendant brings months of fresh personal energy. You may feel inspired to try a new look, change a daily habit or approach people differently, and the changes tend to suit you. Unexpected introductions to interesting people are common. Reinvention feels exciting instead of threatening, so experiment a little with how you show up.",
    hard: "Uranus opposite your Ascendant, crossing the Descendant, tends to shake up relationships over a year or two, bringing sudden meetings, separations or new terms of partnership. The square can bring abrupt changes through career, home or family. Both call for flexibility. Be honest about the freedom you need, communicate changes clearly, and avoid ending things impulsively when a renegotiation would serve better."
  },
  "uranus|mc": {
    conj: "Uranus reaching your Midheaven tends to bring sudden changes in career or public life, often across a year or more. You may leave a job abruptly, launch an unconventional venture or find yourself in a very different role. Recognition can arrive unexpectedly, as can disruptions. The transit asks for alignment between work and authentic purpose. Explore options that let you innovate, and plan transitions carefully so you land somewhere sustainable.",
    soft: "Uranus trine or sextile your Midheaven tends to open unexpected professional possibilities over several months. Freelance work, a side project, new technology or an innovative team may come your way. Colleagues are often more receptive to fresh ideas. Update your skills, reach out to forward-thinking contacts, and propose the change at work you have quietly been sketching.",
    hard: "Uranus square your Midheaven, or opposite it from the fourth house, can disrupt career and home for a year or more. Job changes, relocations, restructures or family surprises may arrive suddenly. You may feel restless in your current role and eager for independence. The challenge is steering change rather than reacting to it. Clarify what you want professionally, build a financial buffer, and let the upheaval point you toward work that fits."
  },
  "uranus|northNode": {
    conj: "Uranus crossing your North Node tends to bring sudden encounters or events that jolt you toward your growth path, often over a year or so. You may feel drawn to unusual people, communities or causes that seem to open doors to a different future. The changes can be exciting and unsettling. Follow the thread that feels like progress, and avoid staying in old grooves simply because they are familiar.",
    soft: "Uranus in trine or sextile to your North Node tends to support growth through the unfamiliar over several months. A new group, a surprising friendship or an unusual idea may move you further in your developmental direction than careful planning would. Say yes to experiments that feel slightly risky but alive, and notice where your curiosity keeps pulling.",
    hard: "Uranus squaring your nodal axis or crossing your South Node can bring abrupt changes that disrupt familiar patterns over a year or so. You may feel pulled between clinging to old habits and leaping into the unknown. Unexpected endings can clear space for growth. Stay flexible, let go of what has served its purpose, and take conscious steps toward the future you are being asked to build."
  },
  "neptune|sun": {
    conj: "Neptune dissolving across your Sun is a slow, once-in-a-lifetime transit that can last two years or more, with several exact passes. Your sense of identity may soften and blur. Ambitions that once drove you can lose their pull, and you may feel more sensitive, spiritual or creative. Some people feel lost or tired for a while; others find new compassion or artistic voice. Guard against deception and escapism, keep practical supports in place, and let a gentler sense of purpose emerge in its own time.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Neptune to your Sun can bring a long period of quiet inspiration, often lasting a year or more. Imagination, empathy and spiritual interest tend to grow. Creative projects, music, meditation or service to others can feel especially rewarding. Let intuition guide you, while keeping enough structure to turn dreams into something tangible.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Sun can create a foggy period of a year or more. Direction may feel unclear, energy low, and confidence shaky. You might idealise someone, be misled, or feel disillusioned about a role that once defined you. The transit asks you to loosen your grip on ego goals. Rest more, check facts carefully, seek honest feedback, and let compassion replace self-criticism. Clarity usually returns once the fog has done its work."
  },
  "neptune|moon": {
    conj: "When Neptune meets your Moon, often over two years or more, emotional boundaries tend to thin. You may absorb other people's feelings, become more intuitive, or feel pulled toward caregiving roles. Dreams can be vivid and moods hard to name. Family situations may involve confusion, sacrifice or longing. This transit can open real compassion and creativity, yet it can also drain you. Protect your energy with solitude and routine, and seek clear information when family matters feel murky.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your Moon tends to deepen sensitivity and imagination over a long stretch. Emotional life may feel gentle, dreamy and receptive. It is a lovely time for creative work, spiritual practice or caring for others in ways that also nourish you. Trust quiet intuitions, and give them some form, such as a journal or art.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Moon can bring a year or more of emotional confusion. You may feel drained, overly responsible for others, or unsure what you actually feel. Home situations may be unclear or involve sacrifice. Escapist habits can creep in when things feel overwhelming. The transit calls for gentler boundaries and honest self-care. Name what you need, avoid rescuing others at your own expense, and ask for help when the waters feel too deep."
  },
  "neptune|mercury": {
    conj: "Neptune crossing your Mercury tends to blend logic with imagination for a year or more. Thinking may become more intuitive, poetic and scattered. Writing, music, film and spiritual study often flourish, while detailed tasks feel harder to track. Misunderstandings and forgetfulness are common, and you may be vulnerable to misinformation. Use the creative gift, but keep lists, double-check details and get agreements in writing.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Neptune to Mercury tends to inspire imaginative thinking over a long period. Creative writing, storytelling, music or intuitive problem solving may flow easily. You may find it natural to express subtle feelings in words. It is a great window for artistic projects and compassionate conversations.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Mercury can cloud thinking for a year or more. Confusion, miscommunication and indecision are common, and you may find details slipping away. Other people's words may be misleading, or your own intentions misunderstood. Protect yourself with clear documentation, simple routines and extra time for decisions. Let imagination play where it belongs, and keep facts and fantasies clearly separate."
  },
  "neptune|venus": {
    conj: "Neptune joining your Venus tends to make love feel romantic, spiritual or idealised for a year or more. You may fall for someone who seems perfect, long for a soulmate, or feel drawn to art, music and beauty. Compassion deepens, but so can illusion. Disappointment often follows when projections meet reality. Enjoy the enchantment, while keeping your eyes open, and let creative outlets carry some of the longing that no single person can meet.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your Venus tends to bring a long, gentle season of romance and creativity. Relationships may feel tender and compassionate, and art, music or dance can be especially nourishing. It is a good time to make something beautiful, deepen intimacy through kindness, or explore spirituality through love.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Venus can bring confusion or disappointment in love and money, often for a year or more. You may idealise a partner, fall for an unavailable person, or overlook red flags. Finances may be unclear or prone to leakage. The transit asks you to see relationships as they are. Keep financial records tidy, check what you are told, and give your longing for beauty and transcendence healthy expression."
  },
  "neptune|mars": {
    conj: "Neptune meeting your Mars tends to soften drive and blur motives for a year or more. You may lose interest in competitive goals, feel less physically energetic, or act for more idealistic reasons. Creative, charitable or spiritual pursuits often become compelling. Frustration can turn inward, and passive resistance may replace direct action. Use the transit to align action with compassion, and listen to your body when it asks for rest.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your Mars tends to inspire action guided by intuition over a long period. You may feel drawn to dance, swimming, creative projects or service-oriented work. Effort often flows without strain when it serves an ideal. Follow those callings, and let imagination lead your energy.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Mars can drain energy and confuse motives for a year or more. You may feel directionless, sapped of drive, or unsure whether to push or yield. Conflict can become covert, and others may undermine you quietly. Physical symptoms may be vague. Rest, gentle exercise and clear agreements help. Clarify what you are fighting for, and avoid getting tangled in schemes you do not fully understand."
  },
  "neptune|jupiter": {
    conj: "Neptune crossing your Jupiter tends to expand spiritual and creative horizons over a year or more. You may feel drawn to faith, mysticism, retreat, travel to sacred places or charitable work. Idealism grows, and generosity can overflow. The risk is inflated hopes or following a charismatic teacher too readily. Let yourself be inspired, while keeping discernment and a grounded plan for how your ideals will be lived out.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Neptune to your Jupiter supports spiritual and creative growth over a long period. You may feel more compassionate, generous and hopeful. Study of philosophy, religion or art can be deeply rewarding. It is a good time to volunteer, explore a spiritual practice or follow an imaginative calling.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Jupiter can bring a year or more of misplaced faith or overblown hopes. You might be tempted by schemes that promise too much, idealise a belief system, or give too freely. Disillusionment can follow. The transit invites you to refine beliefs through experience. Check claims carefully, keep generosity within sensible limits, and look for inspiration that stands up to daylight."
  },
  "neptune|saturn": {
    conj: "When Neptune meets your natal Saturn, structures and certainties may slowly dissolve over a year or more. Careers, rules or responsibilities that once felt solid can become uncertain, and you may feel less sure of your ambitions. Boundaries may blur. This transit invites you to soften rigid expectations and find meaning beyond achievement. Keep practical routines in place, check the fine print, and let compassion enter the areas where you have been hardest on yourself.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your Saturn tends to help ideals take form over a long period. You may find ways to give structure to creative or spiritual work, or bring compassion into responsibilities. It is a good time to build something meaningful slowly, balancing vision with practicality.",
    hard: "Neptune square or opposite your Saturn can undermine structures for a year or more. Plans may become confused, institutions unreliable, or responsibilities overwhelming. You might doubt your competence or feel directionless in your career. The transit asks you to let go of control where it is illusory. Keep records clear, strengthen what is essential, and allow uncertain areas to reveal themselves before committing further."
  },
  "neptune|asc": {
    conj: "Neptune crossing your Ascendant can soften your presence and blur your sense of self over a year or more. You may feel more sensitive, porous and less sure how you come across. Others may project onto you, seeing what they want to see. Creative and spiritual pursuits tend to flourish. Health can feel more delicate. Protect your energy, simplify routines, and let your appearance and style evolve in ways that feel true.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your Ascendant tends to bring a long period of gentle charisma and heightened sensitivity. People may find you more approachable and easier to confide in, and you tend to read a room intuitively. Creative self-expression through clothing, photography, music or movement often flows. Let that softness show, while keeping a few firm routines for rest.",
    hard: "Neptune opposite your Ascendant, crossing the Descendant, often brings a year or more of confusion or idealisation in relationships. You may attract partners who need rescuing, or feel unsure of a relationship's terms. The square can bring confusion through career or family. Both invite clearer boundaries. Watch for projection, be honest about what you see, and seek relationships that support your wellbeing."
  },
  "neptune|mc": {
    conj: "Neptune reaching your Midheaven tends to dissolve old career direction over a year or more. Ambitions may lose their appeal, and you may be drawn toward creative, spiritual or caring work. Public reputation can become unclear, and some people feel invisible or misunderstood at work. Others become known for artistic or compassionate contributions. Let your vocation evolve, keep practical income steady during the transition, and avoid decisions made purely from escape.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your Midheaven tends to inspire career paths aligned with creativity or service over a long period. You may find meaningful work in the arts, healing, charity or spiritual fields. Recognition can come through compassion and imagination. It is a good time to follow a calling while staying grounded.",
    hard: "Neptune square your Midheaven, or opposite it from the fourth house, can blur career and home for a year or more. You may feel lost professionally, disillusioned with employers, or unsure of your direction. Family matters may involve confusion or sacrifice. Guard against deception and unclear contracts. Take time to reflect on what gives your work meaning, and let clarity emerge rather than forcing decisions."
  },
  "neptune|northNode": {
    conj: "Neptune crossing your North Node can bring a year or more of spiritual longing aimed at your growth path. You may feel drawn to art, healing or service in ways that point toward your future. Direction can feel inspired yet vague. Let intuition lead, but anchor it with practical steps, and be wary of teachers or groups that promise too much.",
    soft: "Neptune trine or sextile your North Node tends to support gentle, intuitive growth over a year or more. Creative or spiritual pursuits may nudge you forward without much effort, and chance encounters can feel quietly meaningful. Compassion and imagination help you develop the qualities you are reaching for. Trust subtle guidance, and keep your practices simple enough to sustain.",
    hard: "Neptune squaring your nodal axis or crossing your South Node can blur your sense of direction for a year or more. Old patterns may feel comforting yet unsatisfying, and new paths may seem unclear. You might drift or feel pulled toward escapism. Focus on small, grounded steps toward growth, avoid major decisions based on wishful thinking, and let clarity return gradually."
  },
  "pluto|sun": {
    conj: "Pluto crossing your Sun is among the most intense transits, often lasting two to three years with several exact passes, and many people never experience it. Identity tends to be stripped down and rebuilt. Power struggles, endings, crises or deep psychological work can arise, yet so can a profound renewal of purpose. What survives is what is essential. Face what is changing honestly, seek skilled support, and let yourself be remade from the inside.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Sun tends to empower you over a year or two. You may feel more focused, resilient and able to effect change. Deep work, leadership, research or therapy can be especially productive. It is a good time to take on something significant, reclaim personal power and transform habits with sustained effort.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Sun can bring two or more years of pressure that challenges your sense of self. You may face power struggles with authority or partners, or crises that force change. Old ambitions may need to die for new ones to grow. The transit rewards honesty and courage. Examine where you give away or cling to power, let go of what is finished, and rebuild with intention."
  },
  "pluto|moon": {
    conj: "Pluto joining your Moon tends to stir deep emotional currents over two years or more. Family patterns, childhood wounds or intense attachments often come to the surface. Home life may undergo major change: a move, a death, a birth or a shift in caregiving. Feelings can be overwhelming. This transit invites emotional healing. Allow grief and anger to move, seek therapeutic support if needed, and build a sense of security that does not depend on control.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Moon tends to deepen emotional insight over a year or more. You may find the strength to heal old family patterns or make profound changes at home. Intimacy can intensify in healthy ways. It is a good time for therapy, emotional honesty and rebuilding foundations.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Moon can bring intense emotional upheaval over two years or more. Family dynamics, attachment issues or home changes may force you to confront old fears. You might feel powerless or consumed by strong emotions. The transit calls for courageous self-honesty. Seek support, avoid manipulating or being manipulated, and let deep feelings transform how you care for yourself and others."
  },
  "pluto|mercury": {
    conj: "When Pluto meets your Mercury, thinking tends to become intense, probing and obsessive for a year or more. You may be drawn to research, psychology, investigation or secrets. Communication can carry power: words may persuade or wound. You might uncover hidden information or change your mind radically. Use the depth to study, write or speak truthfully, and be mindful of fixating on problems or using words as weapons.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Mercury tends to sharpen focus and insight over a year or so. Research, writing, negotiation and psychological inquiry can be very productive. You may be able to change minds or uncover hidden truths. It is a strong time for serious study or transformative conversations.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Mercury can bring a year or more of mental pressure. You may encounter power struggles through communication, such as a hostile negotiation, a secret coming to light or a debate that feels like a fight for survival. Obsessive thinking and fear-based worry can take hold at night. The transit asks you to examine what you believe and why. Speak honestly without manipulating, verify information, and give your mind healthy outlets such as research or journalling."
  },
  "pluto|venus": {
    conj: "Pluto crossing your Venus tends to intensify love and values for two years or more. Relationships may become passionate, consuming or transformative; some deepen dramatically and others end. Jealousy, obsession or power dynamics can surface. Finances may shift significantly. This transit strips away superficial attachments. Be honest about what you truly desire, examine patterns of control in love and money, and let relationships evolve toward greater depth.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Venus tends to deepen intimacy and creativity over a year or two. Relationships can grow more honest and passionate, and you may feel ready to show a partner parts of yourself you usually guard. Finances may improve through focused, patient effort. Strengthen bonds that matter, invest with care, and let art carry some of the intensity.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Venus can bring two or more years of intense relational or financial pressure. Power struggles, jealousy or compulsive attractions may arise, and a relationship may end or change profoundly. Money can become a battleground. The transit asks you to confront what you value and why. Seek balanced relationships, avoid manipulation, and rebuild your sense of worth from the inside."
  },
  "pluto|mars": {
    conj: "Pluto joining your Mars tends to bring enormous drive and power over a year or two. You may feel compelled to pursue goals relentlessly, compete intensely or confront injustice. Anger and power struggles can be explosive if unmanaged. Physical strength may increase, and so can risk. Use the intensity for transformative projects, practise self-control, and be alert to situations that could turn dangerous.",
    soft: "A trine or sextile from Pluto to Mars tends to concentrate your willpower over a year or so. You may achieve significant results through sustained, focused effort, and setbacks bother you less than usual. Courage, stamina and determination tend to rise. Tackle a demanding project, rebuild physical strength, or reform a habit you have tried to shift before.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Mars can bring intense conflict over two years or more. Power struggles with a boss, a partner or an institution may challenge your will, and circumstances beyond your control can block direct action. Suppressed anger tends to surface, sometimes as exhaustion. The transit asks you to understand your relationship to power. Direct energy into constructive challenges, walk away from contests that cannot be won cleanly, and seek support if tensions threaten your safety."
  },
  "pluto|jupiter": {
    conj: "Pluto crossing your Jupiter tends to transform beliefs, ambitions and opportunities over a year or more. You may gain influence, pursue large goals or experience a profound shift in faith or worldview. Wealth and power may increase, but so can temptation to overreach. The transit asks for integrity. Use expanded influence ethically, question dogma, and let growth be guided by deeper values.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Jupiter tends to bring significant growth through sustained effort over a year or two. You may gain influence, resources or insight, often by committing deeply to one field instead of sampling many. Serious study, strategic planning and leadership that makes a measurable difference are well supported. Aim higher than usual, and back it with work.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Jupiter can bring power struggles over beliefs or resources for two years or more. You may clash with institutions, face ethical dilemmas at work, or feel pressure to expand at any cost. Overreaching can backfire, particularly in legal or financial matters. The transit asks you to examine your motives honestly. Pursue goals with integrity, be wary of anyone offering certainty, and let crises refine a worldview that has perhaps grown too comfortable."
  },
  "pluto|saturn": {
    conj: "When Pluto meets your natal Saturn, structures and responsibilities tend to be tested at the deepest level over two years or more. Careers, institutions or long-held ambitions may collapse or be radically rebuilt. You may face intense pressure from authorities or circumstances beyond your control. The transit reveals what is truly solid. Rebuild with integrity, release what cannot bear weight, and draw on patience and endurance.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Saturn tends to support deep, lasting change in structures over a year or two. You may reform career or responsibilities in ways that increase stability and power. It is a strong time for strategic planning, disciplined effort and building something that will endure.",
    hard: "Pluto square or opposite your Saturn can bring two or more years of pressure on the structures you rely on. You may confront systems that no longer work, face serious obstacles in a career, or feel crushed by responsibility for others. It can seem as if the ground is being tested beneath every commitment. The transit asks you to rebuild from the foundations up. Face fears directly, accept necessary endings, and invest in structures that reflect what you now value."
  },
  "pluto|asc": {
    conj: "Pluto crossing your Ascendant tends to transform how you present yourself and approach life, often over two years or more. You may feel reborn physically or psychologically, adopt a new appearance, or face crises that reshape your identity. Your presence can become more intense and magnetic. Health may require attention. Allow change to happen, and use your new power wisely.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Ascendant tends to bring a year or two of empowering personal change. You may feel stronger, more focused and more able to influence the people around you, and others often sense a new seriousness in your manner. Reform health routines, update how you present yourself, or commit to a personal direction you intend to keep.",
    hard: "Pluto opposite your Ascendant, crossing the Descendant, tends to bring intense relationship dynamics over two years or more: power struggles, transformative partnerships or significant endings. Someone may arrive who changes you profoundly. The square can bring pressure through career or home, forcing changes you did not choose. Both call for honesty about control and vulnerability. Examine the roles you play with others, set boundaries you can hold, and allow partnerships to change shape."
  },
  "pluto|mc": {
    conj: "Pluto reaching your Midheaven tends to transform career and public life over two years or more. You may gain power and influence, face a professional crisis, or feel compelled to change direction entirely. Authority figures may challenge you, or you may step into authority yourself. The transit asks you to align work with deeper purpose. Use power responsibly, and let go of roles that no longer reflect who you are.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your Midheaven tends to empower your career over a year or two. You may achieve significant professional progress through focused effort, or gain influence with people who make decisions. Reputations built now tend to last. Pursue an ambitious goal, reform something broken in your workplace, or step into leadership with integrity.",
    hard: "Pluto square your Midheaven, or opposite it from the fourth house, can bring two or more years of pressure around career and home. Power struggles at work, restructures, redundancies or family crises may force change. Sometimes the upheaval is quiet, a growing sense that your ambitions belong to someone else. The transit asks you to examine what drives you and what you stand on. Face conflicts honestly, release outdated goals, and rebuild on ground you trust."
  },
  "pluto|northNode": {
    conj: "Pluto crossing your North Node tends to bring intense experiences that push you toward your growth path, often over a year or two. Relationships, crises or encounters may feel fated, as if life has decided to hurry your development. You may be compelled to release comfortable patterns and step into a more powerful version of yourself. Face the transformation with courage, notice who and what keeps appearing, and seek support when it feels overwhelming.",
    soft: "Pluto trine or sextile your North Node tends to support deep growth over a year or two. You may gain insight, strength or opportunities that align with your developmental direction, often through focused work on yourself. Therapy, disciplined practice and relationships that ask for real honesty tend to be especially fruitful. Commit to the changes you already sense are necessary.",
    hard: "Pluto squaring your nodal axis or crossing your South Node can bring intense pressure to release old patterns over two years or more. Power struggles or crises may force you to confront what you cling to. The transit asks you to let go of the past and move forward. Seek support, examine habits honestly, and choose growth even when it feels difficult."
  },
  "chiron|sun": {
    conj: "Chiron crossing your Sun tends to touch the tender places in your identity, often for a year or more because Chiron moves unevenly and retrogrades back over the point. Old doubts about whether you matter, or memories of not being seen by a parent, may resurface. You might feel exposed at work or hesitant to shine. The transit also brings the capacity to heal and to help others with similar wounds. Treat vulnerability as data, get support, and notice how your own story can become useful.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Sun gives several months in which old hurts around confidence can mend more easily. You may find a mentor, therapist or practice that genuinely helps, or discover that your experience is valuable to someone else. Teaching, coaching and creative work that draws on lived experience tend to flow well now.",
    hard: "When Chiron squares or opposes your Sun, usually over many months, you may feel your sense of worth is under review. Criticism can sting more than usual, and situations may echo earlier experiences of being overlooked or judged. Physical energy can dip. The pain often points to a place ready for healing. Rather than proving yourself louder, look at the original wound with compassion, seek skilled help if needed, and let imperfection become part of your authority."
  },
  "chiron|moon": {
    conj: "Chiron meeting your Moon tends to bring family history and early emotional wounds to the surface, often over a year or more. You may revisit how you were cared for as a child, feel unexpectedly raw about a parent, or find yourself caring for someone vulnerable. Sensitivity rises. This transit can open profound emotional healing when you let feelings be witnessed. Choose safe people, allow tears, and give yourself the nurturing you once missed.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Moon tends to support gentle emotional healing over several months. Caring relationships may soothe old wounds, and you may find it easier to talk about feelings. Home can become a place of recovery. It is a good time for therapy, family reconciliation or supporting others through similar experiences.",
    hard: "Chiron square or opposite your Moon can reopen emotional wounds over many months. Family tensions, loneliness or feelings of not being cared for may surface, and moods can feel raw. Old coping strategies may stop working. The transit invites deeper self-care. Name the hurt honestly, seek support, and learn new ways of comforting yourself that do not rely on shutting down or pleasing others."
  },
  "chiron|mercury": {
    conj: "Chiron crossing your Mercury tends to highlight wounds around learning, speaking and being heard, often over a year or so. Memories of being dismissed at school, criticised for how you spoke or misunderstood may resurface. You might hesitate to share ideas or feel especially sensitive to feedback. The transit can also make you a gifted listener, teacher or writer on healing themes. Speak anyway, write things down, and let your voice carry what you have learned.",
    soft: "With Chiron trine or sextile Mercury, conversations and study can become healing over several months. You may find words for experiences you have carried silently, or learn from teachers who understand. Writing, counselling and mentoring tend to flow. It is a good time to tell your story or help others find theirs.",
    hard: "Chiron square or opposite your Mercury can bring months of communication difficulties that touch old sore spots. You may feel misunderstood, doubt your intelligence, or face criticism of your ideas. Learning may feel harder. The transit invites you to heal your relationship with your own voice. Practise speaking with honesty and patience, ask clarifying questions, and remember that clumsy words can still carry truth."
  },
  "chiron|venus": {
    conj: "Chiron meeting your Venus tends to touch wounds around love, beauty and self-worth over a year or so. Old heartbreaks may resurface, or a current relationship may reveal where you feel unlovable. You might become more aware of how you measure yourself against others. This transit can heal deep patterns when you approach them gently. Treat yourself kindly, examine old beliefs about being lovable, and let relationships become places of honesty.",
    soft: "Chiron in trine or sextile to Venus tends to bring healing through love, art and beauty over several months. Kind relationships may soothe old hurts, and creative work can express vulnerability beautifully. It is a lovely time to reconnect with pleasure, forgive past hurts or offer comfort to others.",
    hard: "Chiron square or opposite your Venus can bring months of relational tenderness or pain. You may feel unappreciated by a partner, compare yourself unfavourably with others, or revisit an old heartbreak that seemed settled. Spending and money can trigger insecurity too. The transit invites you to address where you feel unworthy. Seek relationships that respect your vulnerability, examine patterns of self-sacrifice, and let a sense of your own value grow from within."
  },
  "chiron|mars": {
    conj: "Chiron crossing your Mars tends to touch wounds around anger, assertion and physical strength, often over a year or so. You may notice where you were taught that your drive was too much or not enough. Injuries or fatigue may prompt you to listen to your body. The transit can heal your relationship with action, making you a courageous advocate. Move gently, express anger safely, and act on behalf of what matters.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Mars tends to support healing through action over several months. You may find the courage to confront old fears or advocate for yourself and others. Physical therapies, martial arts or purposeful exercise can be particularly beneficial. It is a good time to use strength compassionately.",
    hard: "Chiron square or opposite your Mars can bring months of frustration that echoes old wounds. You may feel powerless, angry or blocked, and conflicts may touch sore spots. Physical strain or minor injuries are possible. The transit asks you to understand your relationship with anger. Express it constructively, rest when your body asks, and seek support in rebuilding healthy assertiveness."
  },
  "chiron|jupiter": {
    conj: "Chiron meeting your Jupiter tends to bring healing through faith, learning or travel over a year or so. You may question beliefs that once comforted you or discover new meaning through adversity. Teachers or teachings may appear that help you make sense of your wounds. Generosity can be healing too. Stay open to new perspectives, and let your understanding of life widen to include what has hurt you.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Jupiter tends to support healing through learning, travel and spiritual exploration over several months. You may find wisdom in experiences that once felt only painful, and a book, retreat or teacher can arrive at the right moment. Study healing practices, share what you have learned, or explore a philosophy that makes room for hurt.",
    hard: "Chiron square or opposite your Jupiter can bring months of doubt about beliefs, opportunities or meaning. You may feel disillusioned with a teacher, a faith or an institution, or wounded by a promise that did not come through. Travel and study plans can meet setbacks. The transit asks you to refine your worldview. Look for perspectives that hold both hope and pain, avoid overcompensating with bravado, and let humility deepen your understanding of what you believe."
  },
  "chiron|saturn": {
    conj: "Chiron crossing your Saturn tends to touch wounds around authority, responsibility and fear of failure over a year or so. You may revisit experiences of harsh criticism or feel inadequate in your role. Old limitations can feel painful. The transit also helps you rebuild self-respect and become a compassionate authority. Face fears step by step, seek mentors who understand, and let your struggles inform your wisdom.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Saturn tends to support healing through discipline and structure over several months. You may find it easier to face long-standing fears, commit to recovery routines, or mentor someone through a difficulty you know well. Responsibility feels less punishing now. It is a good time for steady self-improvement and realistic goals.",
    hard: "Chiron square or opposite your Saturn can bring months of feeling limited, judged or inadequate. A demanding boss, an official process or a heavy responsibility may trigger memories of harsh criticism. You might feel stuck, as though no effort is ever enough. The transit asks you to question inherited rules and fears. Practise self-compassion, take small steady steps, and seek support in reshaping how you relate to duty and achievement."
  },
  "chiron|asc": {
    conj: "Chiron crossing your Ascendant tends to bring wounds around identity, appearance or body image to the surface, often over a year or so. You may feel exposed, self-conscious or unsure how others see you. Health issues may prompt a new relationship with your body. The transit can make you more compassionate and authentic. Treat your body kindly, allow vulnerability, and let your presence become healing for others.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Ascendant tends to support healing in how you present yourself over several months. You may find it easier to accept your appearance or share your story. People may seek your guidance. It is a good time to engage in self-care and compassionate leadership.",
    hard: "Chiron opposite your Ascendant, crossing your Descendant, often brings months of relational healing or pain: partners may mirror your wounds, or someone close may need your care. The square tends to bring sensitivity through career or home, touching old doubts about how you are seen. Both invite you to address vulnerability honestly. Seek relationships that support healing, notice when you slip into the helper role, and avoid rescuing others at your own expense."
  },
  "chiron|mc": {
    conj: "Chiron reaching your Midheaven tends to highlight wounds around career, reputation or purpose over a year or so. You may feel exposed professionally or unsure of your path. Some people shift toward healing, teaching or advocacy work during this transit. It is an invitation to align your vocation with your deepest experiences. Acknowledge career disappointments, and let your wounds shape a more meaningful contribution.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your Midheaven tends to support healing through work over several months. You may find opportunities to help others professionally, or feel more at peace with past career disappointments. Colleagues may seek you out for advice. Explore a vocational shift that honours your experience, or bring more of your lived wisdom into your current role.",
    hard: "Chiron square your Midheaven, or opposite it from the fourth house, can bring months of sensitivity around career and home. You may feel undervalued at work, passed over for recognition, or confronted by family wounds that shaped your ambitions. The transit invites reflection on purpose and roots. Look for work that feels meaningful, address family hurts with care, and let vulnerability guide more authentic choices about where you put your effort."
  },
  "chiron|northNode": {
    conj: "Chiron crossing your North Node tends to bring healing experiences that point you toward your growth path over a year or so. Encounters with healers, teachers or kindred spirits may feel significant, and you may be asked to help others in ways that also help you. Old wounds may resurface precisely so they can be transformed. Follow what feels both healing and forward-moving, and trust that vulnerability can open doors.",
    soft: "Chiron trine or sextile your North Node tends to support growth through healing over several months. You may find people or practices that help you move beyond old patterns, and your own hard-won experience may prove useful to someone else. Therapy, mentoring or compassionate service tend to be especially rewarding. Follow what helps.",
    hard: "Chiron squaring your nodal axis or crossing your South Node can stir old wounds tied to familiar patterns over several months. You may feel pulled back into habits that once helped you cope, such as over-functioning, withdrawing or pleasing others. The transit asks you to acknowledge those patterns with compassion and then choose a different response. Seek support, take gentle steps forward, and notice small signs of progress."
  },
  "uranus|uranus": {
    conj: "The Uranus return arrives around age 84 and can colour a year or more, completing one full cycle of personal awakening. Rather than winding down, many people feel a late surge of independence and curiosity. You may speak your mind more freely, take up an interest you had shelved for decades, or change living arrangements. Frustration with limits imposed by age or family is common too. Let life still surprise you, and pass on what your own unconventional choices have taught you.",
    soft: "Uranus sextile its natal place around age 14 and trine around 28 tend to bring months of growing independence. The earlier aspect stirs a teenager's first real sense of individuality; the later one supports adult choices that express your originality, such as a new field or a move. Use these windows to experiment and claim a little more freedom.",
    hard: "Uranus square natal Uranus around 21 and the opposition around 40 to 42 each unfold over a year or two. At 21 the push is to break from family scripts and test who you are. The opposition is the classic midlife awakening: sudden urges to change career, relationship or lifestyle, and a sharp awareness of time passing. It can feel destabilising. Ask which parts of your life are genuinely yours, make changes deliberately instead of explosively, and keep some anchors steady."
  },
  "neptune|neptune": {
    conj: "Neptune takes about 165 years to circle the zodiac, so no one lives to see a Neptune return. The meaningful milestones are the sextile around 28, the square around 40 to 42, and the trine around 55. Each marks a shift in what you long for and what you are prepared to believe in. You may notice a pull toward spirituality, art or service at these points. Treat them as invitations to check whether your dreams still belong to you.",
    soft: "Neptune's sextile to its natal place around 28 and trine around 55 tend to bring a year or more of quiet spiritual deepening. Intuition and creativity feel more accessible, and you may be drawn to meditation, music, volunteering or a gentler pace. These are good times to explore what genuinely nourishes your inner life and to give it regular space.",
    hard: "Neptune square its natal place around 40 to 42 often lasts a year or two and forms part of the midlife passage, frequently overlapping the Uranus opposition. You may feel disillusioned with goals you once chased, or unsure what you believe. Old dreams can quietly dissolve, and fatigue or vague longing is common. Allow yourself to grieve what is fading, avoid numbing the feeling with alcohol, screens or overwork, and let a more compassionate sense of purpose take shape gradually."
  },
  "pluto|pluto": {
    conj: "At around 248 years, a Pluto return is beyond any human lifespan, so the personal milestones are the sextile, square and trine. For people born from the mid-twentieth century onward, Pluto has moved quickly enough that the square arrives around 36 to 40, with the sextile often in the late teens or twenties. These aspects mark turning points in how you relate to power, control and change. Use them to ask what you are ready to release and what you are ready to claim.",
    soft: "Pluto sextile its natal place, often in the late teens or twenties for recent generations, and the trine later in life tend to bring constructive transformation over a year or two. You may find the strength to leave an unhealthy situation, commit to therapy, or pursue a goal with unusual determination. Change made now tends to go deep and last.",
    hard: "Pluto square its natal place, around 36 to 40 for recent generations, often lasts two years or more. You may feel pressure to confront buried issues around power, control, sexuality, money or mortality, sometimes triggered by a crisis at work or in a relationship. Identities built in your twenties can crumble so that something truer can emerge. The transit calls for courage and honesty. Seek skilled support, face what has been hidden, and allow the change to reach the roots."
  },
  "chiron|chiron": {
    conj: "The Chiron return comes around age 50 and often spans a year or more. It tends to bring your core wound back into view, sometimes through health, loss or a moment of feeling out of place. Yet it also offers integration: you may recognise how your pain has shaped your gifts and your empathy. Many people shift toward teaching, mentoring or healing work at this stage. Honour what you have survived, and let others benefit from what it taught you.",
    soft: "Chiron's sextile and trine to its natal place fall at irregular ages because of its uneven orbit, and each tends to bring several months of healing insight. You may meet the right practitioner, read the right book, or find that talking about an old hurt no longer stings. Use these windows to consolidate progress and support others.",
    hard: "Chiron opposite its natal place arrives somewhere between about 37 and 46, depending on your birth year, and the squares fall earlier and later at irregular ages. Each can reopen sensitive issues over many months. The opposition often feels like a midlife mirror: other people reflect the wound back, or you feel out of step with peers. The transit invites you to meet the hurt with maturity. Acknowledge what still aches, seek support, and let understanding replace self-blame."
  }
};
